meta {
  name: Bulk approve
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/bills/bulk/approve
  body: json
  auth: none
}

body:json {
  {
    "ids": ["{{billId}}"]
  }
}

docs {
  Admin or Approver. Approves every supplied bill independently (each
  in its own transaction). Per-item result: `data` on success, `error`
  on failure. Try mixing a PENDING_APPROVAL id with a DRAFT id — the
  draft fails with BILL_INVALID_TRANSITION while the pending one is
  approved. Viewer -> 403.
}
